></table><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:=
0 0 15px"><span>The situation is similar in Spain, which has one of the old=
est populations in Europe, and where protests over a housing crisis recentl=
y contributed to Prime Minister Pedro S=C3=A1nchez=E2=80=99s decision to ca=
ll new elections. While the face of the protests was </span><a href=3D"http=
s://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/154JhxPq5fQycPCu1wsTnA~~/AAAAARA~/sRbvXvMye=
EaEkyObRzHUnzfFijgT8b6Dubzi4dc-ZZShYQ_tKGR4CzFvfB-uTZcmFmTzTn6F5wbz4NZq833Q=
IVFHwqPKiS9eUZRDJXJNNHD0RzRF07lM1IGrZsUvf6jHadparxewlUPloYsTvAL3cKg4L1whWJh=
RieMNCPMzbgMaXaZks7gD8HTw7_NVZb1haeIv-4by5oM5ACiV8Jt2Lr0QdcHoF-qCkUYmlBp8zp=
RfF9fBPSFkLPllI659KIgl3A3tok0YnAdk1IoQtzlRs42nWWiNKOZzJe-agkrcBws3E8Ug_-UkX=
_589X5SsgCTAZA8jXEWF6HGBQOltZnSaI5VWYn8rju9wvxlEHhcDbowqAuUE4-4mdKl-FglW5wP=
kjBDznUH80iO1sv56ReI7w~~" class=3D"css-sdwaa1" style=3D"color:#286ed0;-webk=
it-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline">an 87-year-old rent=
er</a><span>, many young people joined, because the housing crisis dispropo=
rtionately affects them.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgi=
a,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Spanish youth unemployment is ove=
r 22 percent. House prices have risen far more quickly than wages, adding t=
o the wealth of older generations, but leaving many young people with a cho=
ice of living with their parents well into their 30s or sacrificing savings=
 to pay a steep rent.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,s=
erif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>In Britain, the youth unemployment r=
ate is lower, around 16 percent. But housing costs are steep, particularly =
in and around London, where most job growth is located. And the country has=
 committed to the so-called =E2=80=9Ctriple lock,=E2=80=9D a policy that ha=
